---
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_TAGLINE } from '../consts';
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="container footer-container">
		<div class="footer-top">
			<div class="footer-brand">
				<div class="brand-line">
					<div class="logo-icon-sm">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
							<path d="M22 2L11 13"></path>
							<path d="M22 2L15 22L11 13L2 9L22 2Z"></path>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<span class="brand-title">{SITE_NAME}<span class="brand-tld">.org</span></span>
				</div>
				<p class="brand-desc">
					{SITE_TAGLINE}。专注2026优质稳定高速机场推荐、服务商晚高峰深度实测、IEPL专线测评、客户端配置教程及流媒体AI原生解锁指南。坚持独立客观、拒绝虚标夸大。
				</p>
				<div class="footer-badges">
					<span class="badge badge-emerald">真实实测数据</span>
					<span class="badge badge-cyan">晚高峰持续监测</span>
					<span class="badge badge-amber">拒绝虚标跑路云</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-links-group">
				<h4 class="links-title">快捷导航</h4>
				<ul class="links-list">
					<li><a href="/">首页</a></li>
					<li><a href="/ranking">2026 机场天梯榜</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog">深度实测文章</a></li>
					<li><a href="/clients">全平台客户端</a></li>
					<li><a href="/tools">网络测速工具箱</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-links-group">
				<h4 class="links-title">客户端教程</h4>
				<ul class="links-list">
					<li><a href="/blog/clash-verge-rev-guide/">Clash Verge Rev</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog/sing-box-universal-guide/">Sing-box 极简配置</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog/shadowrocket-ios-tutorial/">Shadowrocket 小火箭</a></li>
					<li><a href="/blog/v2rayn-v2rayng-setup-guide/">v2rayN / v2rayNG</a></li>
					<li><a href="/clients">全平台客户端中心</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-links-group">
				<h4 class="links-title">声明与支持</h4>
				<ul class="links-list">
					<li><a href="/about">关于本站原则</a></li>
					<li><a href="/about#disclaimer">法律免责声明</a></li>
					<li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅源</a></li>
					<li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">网站地图</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-disclaimer">
			<p>
				<strong>免责声明：</strong>本站（Jichangs.org / 机场搜）发表的所有测评数据、技术指南及网络工具解析，仅供外贸从业、跨国科研、计算机网络学术交流与合法学习之用。请广大用户自觉遵守国家及当地法律法规，严禁利用网络代理从事任何违法犯罪活动。
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-bottom">
			<p class="copyright">
				&copy; {today.getFullYear()} <strong>Jichangs.org</strong>. 机场搜. All rights reserved.
			</p>
			<div class="footer-tags">
				<span>基于 Astro 构建</span>
				<span>/</span>
				<span>全球高速边缘分发</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		margin-top: auto;
		background: var(--bg-secondary);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.footer-container {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.footer-top {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.footer-brand {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.brand-line {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.logo-icon-sm {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 28px;
		height: 28px;
		background: #2563eb;
		color: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid #3b82f6;
	}

	.brand-title {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.brand-tld {
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.brand-desc {
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.footer-badges {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	.links-title {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
	}

	.links-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.65rem;
	}

	.links-list a {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.links-list a:hover {
		color: #38bdf8;
		padding-left: 2px;
	}

	.footer-disclaimer {
		padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.footer-disclaimer strong {
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.footer-disclaimer p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.copyright {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.footer-tags {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.footer-top {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
		.footer-brand {
			grid-column: span 2;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.footer-top {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.footer-brand {
			grid-column: span 1;
		}
		.footer-bottom {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
	}
</style>
